OL,6,     FBy James Henry. Five colourful
OL,7,     Fdetectives awaken in a country
OL,8,     Fhouse with a corpse, no escape and
OL,9,     Fno memory. Part comedy-mystery,
OL,10,     Fpart cosmic-horror, where nothing
OL,11,     Fobeys the rules.
